  "slug": "better-late-than-never",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2941_better-late-than-never.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Once upon a time, a man kept many sheep. One morning, as he was getting ready to take them out to graze, he noticed that one was missing. It turned out there was a hole in the sheep pen. During the night, a wolf had crawled through it and carried off a sheep. His neighbor advised him, “Hurry and fix the pen. Block up that hole!” But the man said, “The sheep is already gone. What’s the point of fixing the pen now?” So he ignored his neighbor’s advice.",
    "The next morning, as he was getting ready to take the sheep out to graze, he found that another one was missing. The wolf had crawled through the hole again and carried off another sheep. He regretted not listening to his neighbor, so he quickly blocked the hole and repaired the pen until it was strong and secure. From then on, no wolf ever carried off another of his sheep.",
    "Even after you lose a sheep, fixing the pen can keep you from losing the rest. In the same way, correcting a mistake right away can prevent further mistakes and losses."
  ],
  "english_full": "Once upon a time, a man kept many sheep. One morning, as he was getting ready to take them out to graze, he noticed that one was missing. It turned out there was a hole in the sheep pen. During the night, a wolf had crawled through it and carried off a sheep. His neighbor advised him, “Hurry and fix the pen. Block up that hole!” But the man said, “The sheep is already gone. What’s the point of fixing the pen now?” So he ignored his neighbor’s advice.\n\nThe next morning, as he was getting ready to take the sheep out to graze, he found that another one was missing. The wolf had crawled through the hole again and carried off another sheep. He regretted not listening to his neighbor, so he quickly blocked the hole and repaired the pen until it was strong and secure. From then on, no wolf ever carried off another of his sheep.\n\nEven after you lose a sheep, fixing the pen can keep you from losing the rest. In the same way, correcting a mistake right away can prevent further mistakes and losses.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Оди́н раз, дя́дя держал мно́гие овцы. О́дним у́тром, когда́ он гото́вился вы́вести их на пасу́шку, он заме́тил, что одна́ овца́ отсу́тствует. Оказа́лось, что в заго́не есть ка́рцер. Во вре́мя ночи́, волк про́полз через него и ута́щил овцу́. Его́ сосе́д посове́товал ему: «Спе́шите и по́чините заго́н. Заблоки́руйте этот ка́рцер!» Но дя́дя ска́зал: «Овца́ уже́ ушла. Како́й смысл по́чинить заго́н сейча́с?» Так он игнорирова́л сове́т сосе́да.",
    "На следу́ющее у́тро, когда́ он гото́вился вы́вести овец на пасу́шку, он на́шёл, что ещё одна́ овца́ отсу́тствует. Волк про́полз через ка́рцер снова́ и ута́щил ещё одну овцу́. Он сожале́л, что не слуша́л своего́ сосе́да, поэтому он бы́стро заблоки́ровал ка́рцер и по́чинил заго́н, пока́ он не стал мо́щным и надёжным. С тех пор ни один волк никогда не ута́щил другую его овцу́.",
    "Даже после того, как вы потеря́ли овцу́, по́чинка заго́на может предотврати́ть потерю остальных. Так же, как и исправле́ние оши́бки немедленно может предотврати́ть и́збежание дальне́йших оши́бок и поте́р."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Odín raz, diádya derzhal mnógie ovtsy. Ódnym útrom, kogáda on gotóvilsya vývesti ikh na pasúshku, on zamétil, chto odná ovtsá ótstútstvuet. Okazalós, chto v zágone yest' kárcer. Vo vreḿya nochí, volk prólpz cherez nego i utáshchil ovtsú. Yegó sośed posovétoval emu: «Spéshite i póchinike zágon. Zablockirúite etot kárcer!» No diádya skázal: «Ovtsá úzhe ushla. Kakóy smysl póchinike zágon séychas?» Tak on ignoriróval sovet sośeda.",
    "Na sledúyushchee útro, kogáda on gotóvilsya vývesti ovets na pasúshku, on náshël, chto éshche odná ovtsá ótstútstvuet. Volk prólpz cherez kárcer s nová i utáshchil éshche odnu ovtsú. On sózhalel, chto ne slushal svóego sośeda, poetomu on býstro zablockiróval kárcer i póchinyal zágon, poká on ne stal móshchnym i nadyózhnym. S tékh por ni odin volk nikogdá ne utáshchil druguyu yégo ovtsú.",
    "Dazhe posle tógo, kak vy poterýali ovtsú, póchinika zágona mozhet predotvratít' poteryu ostat́nykh. Tak zhe, kak i ispravlénie oshíbki nemedlenno mozhet predotvratít' ízbézhaniye dal'nýshikh oshíbok i poterý."
  ],
